{"ex-3A02-1":{"id":"ex-3A02-1","chapter":"3A02","number":1,"title":"應用斯涅耳定律","question":"<p>如圖所示，光線從空氣進入介質 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span>，當 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 15°，</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 10°。</p><p>(a) 求 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{sin i}{sin r}</annotation></semantics></math></span>。</p><p>(b) 當 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 60°，<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span> 是多少？</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/1575f09c744aaa6884ef8cd3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:142.1px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{sin i}{sin r}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mn>15</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{sin 15°}{sin 10°}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 1.49</p><p>(b) 根據斯涅耳定律，</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mn>60</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{sin 60°}{sin r}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mn>15</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{sin 15°}{sin 10°}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 35.5°</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_3A02_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"7ecff66bdafc3d73283c6bb88cceb3d538a57d1ff02d6cbab6ec10b01f9819b1","segments":[{"page":8,"kind":"question","box":[180.6491,441.4318951171875,557.6491,601.7478942871094],"text":"例 題 1 應用斯涅耳定律\r\n如圖所示，光線從空氣進入介質 X，當 i = 15°，\r\nr = 10°。\r\n(a) 求 sin i\r\nsin r\r\n。\r\n(b) 當 i = 60°，r 是多少？\r\n"},{"page":8,"kind":"answer","box":[180.6491,601.7478942871094,557.6491,743.2848951171875],"text":"題 解\r\n(a) sin i\r\nsin r\r\n = sin 15°\r\nsin 10° = 1.49\r\n(b) 根據斯涅耳定律，\r\nsin 60°\r\nsin r = sin 15°\r\nsin 10°\r\nr = 35.5°\r\nX\r\ni\r\nr\r\n空氣\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-3A02-2":{"id":"ex-3A02-2","chapter":"3A02","number":2,"title":"折射率","question":"<p>康妮把光線從玻璃射進空氣（圖 a），並標繪 sin <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span> 對 sin <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的關係線圖（圖 b）。</p><p>圖 a</p><p>(a) 求玻璃的折射率 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{g}</annotation></semantics></math></span>。</p><p>(b) 康妮改為把光線從介質 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> 射進空氣，介質 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的折射率小於玻璃。</p><p>在圖 b 中草繪 sin <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span> 對 sin <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的關係線圖。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/f9d26056d0b3fdf4934e0bfc.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:460.3px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{g}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>a</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{sin θ_{a}}{sin θ_{g}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{sin r}{sin i}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 斜率 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>0.6</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>0.4</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{0.6 - 0}{0.4 - 0}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 1.5</p><p>(b)</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/f54c95866f46bde7f171122f.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:183.6px\"/></p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>計算 n 時採用圖線的斜率，而非單一數據點，這樣可平均各次量度的誤差。日常生活中的介質折射率都大於 1。如果得到 n &lt; 1，應檢查答案。</p><p>提示</p><p>∴ n = 斜率</p><p>n ↓ ⇒ 斜率 ↓</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_3A02_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"7ecff66bdafc3d73283c6bb88cceb3d538a57d1ff02d6cbab6ec10b01f9819b1","segments":[{"page":10,"kind":"question","box":[180.4491,272.08889511718746,557.4491,554.1449890136719],"text":"例 題 2 折射率\r\n康妮把光線從玻璃射進空氣（圖 a），並標繪 sin r 對 sin i 的關係線圖\r\n（圖 b）。\r\nr\r\ni\r\n空氣\r\n玻璃\r\n圖 a\r\nsin i\r\nsin r\r\n0.6\r\n0.4\r\n0.2\r\n0 圖 b 0.2 0.4 0.6\r\n(a) 求玻璃的折射率 ng。\r\n(b) 康妮改為把光線從介質 X 射進空氣，介質 X 的折射率小於玻璃。\r\n在圖 b 中草繪 sin r 對 sin i 的關係線圖。\r\n"},{"page":10,"kind":"answer","box":[180.4491,554.1449890136719,557.4491,743.2848951171875],"text":"題 解\r\n(a) ng = sin θ a\r\nsin θ g\r\n = sin r\r\nsin i\r\n = 斜率 = 0.6 – 0\r\n0.4 – 0\r\n = 1.5\r\n(b) \r\nsin i\r\nX\r\nsin r\r\n0.6\r\n0.4\r\n0.2\r\n0 0.2 0.4 0.6\r\n"},{"page":10,"kind":"tips","box":[40,268.08889511718746,176.4491,743.2848951171875],"text":"提提你\r\n為抵消各組數據的量度誤\r\n差，我們會用圖線的斜率來\r\n計算 n，而不只用單一組數\r\n據計算。\r\n日常生活中不同介質的折射\r\n率都大於1，如果你計算出\r\n來的 n < 1，便應該檢查答\r\n案。\r\n提提你\r\n∴\r\nn = 斜率\r\nn ↓ ⇒ 斜率 ↓\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-3A02-3":{"id":"ex-3A02-3","chapter":"3A02","number":3,"title":"斯涅耳定律的一般形式","question":"<p>光線從玻璃射入介質 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span>。玻璃的折射率是 1.50。如果 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> 是</p><p>(a) 空氣；</p><p>(b) 水（折射率 = 1.33）；</p><p>(c) 油（折射率 = 1.47）；</p><p>折射角是多少？</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/cc062a6877ea815695d56180.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:151.9px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>θ<sub>g</sub> = 90° – 60° = 30° 應用 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{g}</annotation></semantics></math></span> sin θ<sub>g</sub> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>X</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{X}</annotation></semantics></math></span> sin θ<sub>X</sub>。</p><p>(a) 1.50 × sin 30° = 1 × sin θ<sub>a</sub></p><p>θ<sub>a</sub> = 48.6°</p><p>(b) 1.50 × sin 30° = 1.33 × sin θ<sub>w</sub></p><p>θ<sub>w</sub> = 34.3°</p><p>(c) 1.50 × sin 30° = 1.47 × sin θ<sub>o</sub></p><p>θ<sub>o</sub> = 30.7°</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/81bca9cc716a71a6e8eeffe7.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:151.9px\"/></p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_3A02_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"7ecff66bdafc3d73283c6bb88cceb3d538a57d1ff02d6cbab6ec10b01f9819b1","segments":[{"page":12,"kind":"question","box":[180.4491,401.63189511718747,557.4491,553.947998046875],"text":"例 題 3 斯涅耳定律的一般形式\r\n光線從玻璃射入介質 X。玻璃的折射率是 1.50。如果 X 是\r\n(a) 空氣；\r\n(b) 水（折射率 = 1.33）；\r\n(c) 油（折射率 = 1.47）；\r\n折射角是多少？\r\n"},{"page":12,"kind":"answer","box":[180.4491,553.947998046875,557.4491,756.4848951171875],"text":"題 解\r\nθ g = 90° – 60° = 30°\r\n應用 ng sin θ g = nX sin θ X。\r\n(a) 1.50 × sin 30° = 1 × sin θ a\r\n\tθ a = 48.6°\r\n(b) 1.50 × sin 30° = 1.33 × sin θ w\r\n\tθ w = 34.3°\r\n(c) 1.50 × sin 30° = 1.47 × sin θ o\r\n\tθ o = 30.7°\r\n60°\r\nX\r\n玻璃\r\n60°\r\nX\r\nθx\r\nθg\r\n玻璃\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-3A02-4":{"id":"ex-3A02-4","chapter":"3A02","number":4,"title":"計算光在不同介質中的速率","question":"<p>(a) 光在空氣中的速率是 3.00 × 10<sup>8</sup> m s<sup>–1</sup>，而水的折射率是 1.33。求光在水中的速率。</p><p>(b) 光線從介質 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> 進入介質 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span> 時，速率由 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>X</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_{X}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 變為 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>Y</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_{Y}</annotation></semantics></math></span>。已知入射角和</p><p>折射角分別是 θ<sub>X</sub> 和 θ<sub>Y</sub>，證明 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>Y</mi></msub><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>X</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{v_{Y}}{v_{X}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>Y</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>X</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{sin θ_{Y}}{sin θ_{X}}</annotation></semantics></math></span>。</p>","answer":"<p>(a) 光在水中的速率 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>c</mi><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{c}{n}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>3.00</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup></mrow><mn>1.33</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{3.00 \\times  10^{8}}{1.33}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 2.26 × 10<sup>8</sup> m s<sup>–1</sup></p><p>(b) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>X</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{X}</annotation></semantics></math></span> sin θ<sub>X</sub> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>Y</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{Y}</annotation></semantics></math></span> sin θ<sub>Y</sub></p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>c</mi><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>X</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{c}{v_{X}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> × sin θ<sub>X</sub> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>c</mi><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>Y</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{c}{v_{Y}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> × sin θ<sub>Y</sub></p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>Y</mi></msub><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>X</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{v_{Y}}{v_{X}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>Y</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>X</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{sin θ_{Y}}{sin θ_{X}}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_3A02_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"7ecff66bdafc3d73283c6bb88cceb3d538a57d1ff02d6cbab6ec10b01f9819b1","segments":[{"page":15,"kind":"question","box":[185.4441,439.5848951171875,562.4440999999999,588.9010009765625],"text":"例 題 4 計算光在不同介質中的速率\r\n(a) 光在空氣中的速率是 3.00 × 108\r\n m s–1，而水的折射率是 1.33。求\r\n光在水中的速率。\r\n(b) 光線從介質 X 進入介質 Y 時，速率由 vX 變為 vY。已知入射角和\r\n折射角分別是 θ X 和 θ Y，證明 vY\r\nvX\r\n = sin θ Y\r\nsin θ X\r\n。\r\n"},{"page":15,"kind":"answer","box":[185.4441,588.9010009765625,562.4440999999999,743.5848951171876],"text":"題 解\r\n(a) 光在水中的速率 v = c\r\nn\r\n = 3.00 × 108\r\n1.33\r\n = 2.26 × 108\r\n m s–1\r\n(b) nX sin θ X = nY sin θ Y\r\nc\r\nvX\r\n× sin θ X = c\r\nvY\r\n× sin θ Y\r\nvY\r\nvX\r\n = sin θ Y\r\nsin θ X\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-3A02-5":{"id":"ex-3A02-5","chapter":"3A02","number":5,"title":"光在不同介質中的速率","question":"<p>如圖所示，光穿過介質 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span>、<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Z</annotation></semantics></math></span>。各介質之間的交界面互相平行。</p><p>(a) 哪個介質的折射率最小？試解釋。</p><p>(b) 光在哪個介質中傳播得最快？試解釋。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/ca6dca9966b783c6805d98a9.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:163.9px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) 因為 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>X</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{X}</annotation></semantics></math></span> sin θ<sub>X</sub> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>Y</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{Y}</annotation></semantics></math></span> sin θ<sub>Y</sub> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>Z</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{Z}</annotation></semantics></math></span> sin θ<sub>Z</sub>，θ<sub>X</sub> &gt; θ<sub>Z</sub> &gt; θ<sub>Y</sub> ⇒ <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>X</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{X}</annotation></semantics></math></span> &lt; <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>Z</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{Z}</annotation></semantics></math></span> &lt; <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>Y</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{Y}</annotation></semantics></math></span> ∴ 介質 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的折射率最小。</p><p>(b) 由於 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>c</mi><mi>v</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{c}{v}</annotation></semantics></math></span>，</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>X</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{X}</annotation></semantics></math></span> &lt; <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>Z</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{Z}</annotation></semantics></math></span> &lt; <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>Y</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{Y}</annotation></semantics></math></span> ⇒ <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>X</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_{X}</annotation></semantics></math></span> &gt; <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>Z</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_{Z}</annotation></semantics></math></span> &gt; <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>Y</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_{Y}</annotation></semantics></math></span> ∴ 光在介質 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> 中傳播得最快。</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_3A02_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"7ecff66bdafc3d73283c6bb88cceb3d538a57d1ff02d6cbab6ec10b01f9819b1","segments":[{"page":16,"kind":"question","box":[180.6491,53.49989511718741,557.6491,220.81585693359375],"text":"例 題 5 光在不同介質中的速率\r\n如圖所示，光穿過介質 X、Y 和 Z。各介質之\r\n間的交界面互相平行。\r\n(a) 哪個介質的折射率最小？試解釋。\r\n(b) 光在哪個介質中傳播得最快？試解釋。\r\n"},{"page":16,"kind":"answer","box":[180.6491,220.81585693359375,557.6491,394.8528951171875],"text":"題 解\r\n(a) 因為 nX sin θ X = nY sin θ Y = nZ sin θ Z，\r\nθ X > θ Z > θ Y ⇒ nX < nZ < nY\r\n∴ 介質 X 的折射率最小。\r\n(b) 由於 n = c\r\nv\r\n，\r\nnX < nZ < nY ⇒ vX > vZ > vY\r\n∴ 光在介質 X 中傳播得最快。\r\nX\r\nY\r\nZ\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-3A02-6":{"id":"ex-3A02-6","chapter":"3A02","number":6,"title":"全內反射","question":"<p>水的折射率是 1.33。</p><p>(a) 求水和空氣交界面的臨界角。</p><p>(b) 在下列情況中，光線會發生全內反射嗎？</p><p>(i) (ii)</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/7dafd781a7023f9870ed5052.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:400.4px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) sin <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>C</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>n</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>3</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>3</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>C</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> = 48.8°</p><p>(b) (i) Yes</p><p>(ii) No</p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>i &gt; C</p><p>提示</p><p>當光由光疏介質</p><p>（空氣）進入光密介質（水）時，絕不會發生全內反射。</p>","think":"<p>如果以折射率為 1.5 的玻璃取代水，(b) 的答案會否改變？</p>","thinkAnswer":"<p>不會。玻璃與空氣界面的臨界角為 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>sin</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>−</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup><mrow><mtext>(</mtext></mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>5</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mtext>)</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>4</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>8</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>°</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></math>。在 (i) 中，光由玻璃射向空氣，入射角 50° 大於臨界角，因此仍會發生全內反射。在 (ii) 中，光由空氣射入玻璃，因此仍不可能發生全內反射。</p>","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_3A02_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"7ecff66bdafc3d73283c6bb88cceb3d538a57d1ff02d6cbab6ec10b01f9819b1","segments":[{"page":22,"kind":"question","box":[180.4491,345.6908951171875,557.4491,550.2493896484375],"text":"例 題 6 全內反射\r\n水的折射率是 1.33。\r\n(a) 求水和空氣交界面的臨界角。\r\n(b) 在下列情況中，光線會發生全內反射嗎？\r\n(i) \r\n50°\r\n空氣\r\n水\r\n(ii) 50°\r\n空氣\r\n水\r\n"},{"page":22,"kind":"answer","box":[180.4491,550.2493896484375,557.4491,684.2868951171876],"text":"題 解\r\n(a) sin C = 1\r\nn = 1\r\n1.33\r\nC = 48.8°\r\n(b) (i) 會\r\n(ii) 不會\r\n"},{"page":22,"kind":"tips","box":[40,341.6908951171875,176.4491,684.2868951171876],"text":"全內反射的小戲法\r\n您可以利用全內反射來\r\n表演一些小戲法。\r\n牛津電子資源\r\n知多一點\r\n提提你\r\ni > C\r\n提提你\r\n光從光疏介質（空氣）進入\r\n光密介質（水）時，不會發"},{"page":22,"kind":"answer","box":[177.4488,673.2858951171875,560.4488,745.9998951171875],"text":"想一想\r\n如果把 (b) 部的水改為折射率 1.5 的玻璃，答案會否改變？\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":"Complete Chinese translation of the English supplementary answer","sharedMathematicalAnswer":true,"englishAlignedFields":["thinkAnswer","tips","think"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-3A02-7":{"id":"ex-3A02-7","chapter":"3A02","number":7,"title":"穿過物料塊的光線 (I)","question":"<p>如圖所示，光線射向玻璃塊。草繪光線的路徑。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/bf3e5a0b75c855d4c41b0d16.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:200.2px\"/></p>","answer":"<p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/a7e79a45e22811461eb06910.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:223.6px\"/></p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>n = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>s</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>i</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>n</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>6</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>°</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>s</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>i</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>n</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>3</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>3</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>°</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = 1.62</p><p>sin C = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>n</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>6</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math></p><p>C = 38.1°</p><p>在 AB 邊，</p><p>i = 90° – 32.3°</p><p>= 57.7°</p><p>&gt; 38.1°</p><p>∴ 發生全內反射。</p><p></p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_3A02_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"7ecff66bdafc3d73283c6bb88cceb3d538a57d1ff02d6cbab6ec10b01f9819b1","segments":[{"page":23,"kind":"question","box":[185.4491,53.49989511718752,562.4491,229.8150634765625],"text":"例 題 7 穿過物料塊的光線 (I)\r\n如圖所示，光線射向玻璃塊。草繪光線的路徑。\r\n60°\r\n32.3°\r\nD\r\nA B\r\n空氣 C\r\n玻璃\r\n"},{"page":23,"kind":"answer","box":[185.4491,229.8150634765625,562.4491,367.0558951171875],"text":"題 解\r\n60°\r\n57.7°\r\n32.3°\r\n57.7°\r\n60° 32.3°\r\nD\r\nA B\r\n空氣 C\r\n玻璃\r\n"},{"page":23,"kind":"tips","box":[40,49.49989511718752,181.4491,367.0558951171875],"text":"提提你\r\nn = sin 60°\r\nsin 32.3°\r\n = 1.62\r\nsin C = 1\r\nn\r\n = 1\r\n1.62\r\nC = 38.1°\r\n在表面 AB，\r\ni = 90° – 32.3°\r\n = 57.7°\r\n> 38.1°\r\n∴ 光線會發生全內反射。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"sharedMathematicalAnswer":true,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-3A02-8":{"id":"ex-3A02-8","chapter":"3A02","number":8,"title":"海市蜃樓","question":"<p>如下圖所示，來自天空的光線通過不同的空氣層。這些空氣層互相平行，各有不同的折射率。</p><p>圖不依比例繪製n<sub>1</sub> θ<sup>1</sup> 觀察者n<sub>2</sub> θ<sup>2</sup> n<sub>3</sub> θ<sub>3</sub> θ<sup>3</sup> θ<sup>4</sup> θ<sup>4</sup> n<sub>4</sub> θ<sup>5</sup> θ<sup>5</sup> n<sub>5</sub> n<sub>6</sub></p><p>(a) 已知 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 1.000 273，<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>5</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{5}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 1.000 233，如果 θ<sub>5</sub> = 90°，求 θ<sub>1</sub>。</p><p>(b) 觀察者在他前方的地面看見天空的像。如果他向前走，會更接近像嗎？試解釋。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/0a2068ab5f27cdbee1a8d77a.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:525.5px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> sin θ<sub>1</sub> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span> sin θ<sub>2</sub> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{3}</annotation></semantics></math></span> sin θ<sub>3</sub> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{4}</annotation></semantics></math></span> sin θ<sub>4</sub> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>5</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{5}</annotation></semantics></math></span> sin θ<sub>5</sub></p><p>sin θ<sub>1</sub> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{n_{5}}{n_{1}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> sin θ<sub>5</sub> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1.000233</mn><mn>1.000273</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1.000 233}{1.000 273}</annotation></semantics></math></span> sin 90°</p><p>θ<sub>1</sub> = 89.5°</p><p>(b) 不會，即使觀察者向前走，天空的像依然以相同的角度經光的反射形成。</p><p>複習2 Q28 (p.75)</p><p>溫習 2 第 28 題（第 75 頁）</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_3A02_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"7ecff66bdafc3d73283c6bb88cceb3d538a57d1ff02d6cbab6ec10b01f9819b1","segments":[{"page":26,"kind":"question","box":[180.4491,294.0828951171875,557.4491,563.1997985839844],"text":"例 題 8 海市蜃樓\r\n如下圖所示，來自天空的光線通過不同的空氣層。這些空氣層互相平\r\n行，各有不同的折射率。\r\nn6\r\nn5\r\nn4\r\nn3\r\nn2\r\nn1\r\nθ 1\r\nθ 2\r\nθ 3 θ 3\r\nθ4 θ4\r\nθ 5 θ 5\r\n觀察者\r\n圖不依比例繪製\r\n(a) 已知 n1 = 1.000 273，n5 = 1.000 233，如果 θ 5 = 90°，求 θ 1。\r\n(b) 觀察者在他前方的地面看見天空的像。如果他向前走，會更接近\r\n像嗎？試解釋。\r\n"},{"page":26,"kind":"answer","box":[180.4491,563.1997985839844,557.4491,743.2848951171875],"text":"題 解\r\n(a) n1 sin θ 1 = n2 sin θ 2 = n3 sin θ 3 = n4 sin θ 4 = n5 sin θ 5\r\n sin θ 1 = n5\r\nn1\r\n sin θ 5 = 1.000 233\r\n1.000 273\r\n sin 90°\r\nθ 1 = 89.5°\r\n(b) 不會，即使觀察者向前走，天空的像依然以相同的角度經光的反\r\n射形成。\r\n複習2 Q28 (p.75)\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-3A02-9":{"id":"ex-3A02-9","chapter":"3A02","number":9,"title":"潛水員視域的半徑","question":"<p>水中的潛水員向上望，他的視域會壓縮成一個圓形，這個圓形的半徑 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span> 是多少？潛水員的眼晴在水面以下 0.5 m 的位置，水的折射率是1.33。</p>","answer":"<p>sin <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>C</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>n</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>3</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>3</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>C</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> = 48.75°</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>R</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> = 0.5 tan 48.75° = 0.570 m</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/dfb0740440ed61dfa9b6724f.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:239.1px\"/></p>","tips":"","think":"<p>如果潛水員位於更深的位置，θ 和 R 會如何改變？</p>","thinkAnswer":"<p>視角 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>θ</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> 不變，因為它由臨界角決定，而臨界角只取決於折射率。半角為 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>4</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>8</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>7</mtext></mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>5</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>°</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></math>，整個圓錐的頂角為 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>9</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>7</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>5</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>°</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></math>。半徑會增加：<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>R</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>h</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>tan</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>C</mtext></mrow></mrow></math>，所以它與深度 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>h</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> 成正比。</p>","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_3A02_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"7ecff66bdafc3d73283c6bb88cceb3d538a57d1ff02d6cbab6ec10b01f9819b1","segments":[{"page":27,"kind":"question","box":[185.6491,369.9818951171875,562.6491,487.2978820800781],"text":"複習 2 Q8 (p.69)\r\n例 題 9 潛水員視域的半徑\r\n水中的潛水員向上望，他的視域會壓縮成一個圓形，這個圓形的半\r\n徑 R 是多少？潛水員的眼晴在水面以下 0.5 m 的位置，水的折射率是\r\n1.33。\r\n"},{"page":27,"kind":"answer","box":[185.6491,487.2978820800781,562.6491,684.5708951171875],"text":"題 解\r\nsin C = 1\r\nn\r\n = 1\r\n1.33\r\nC = 48.75°\r\nR = 0.5 tan 48.75° = 0.570 m\r\nR\r\nC C 0.5 m θ θ\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":"Complete Chinese translation of the English supplementary answer","sharedMathematicalAnswer":true,"englishAlignedFields":["tips","think","thinkAnswer"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-3A02-10":{"id":"ex-3A02-10","chapter":"3A02","number":10,"title":"光纖包覆層的作用","question":"<p>一款簡單的光纖由塑膠內芯製成，且沒有包覆層。塑膠的折射率是 1.62。如圖所示，光線從光纖的一端沿法線進入，並到達 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點。</p><p>(a) 折射率為 1.7 的污垢意外地黏附在光纖外層的 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點上。解釋光線到達 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點時會否發生全內反射。</p><p>(b) 如果以折射率為 1.52 的包覆層包裹內心，光線到達 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點時會否發生全內反射？</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/4118f4903d28eb437be86ff7.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:192.8px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) 不會發生全內反射。污垢的折射率比纖芯大，因此光會折射進入污垢。</p><p>(b) 根據斯涅耳定律，</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>n</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></math> sin θ<sub>1</sub> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>n</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></math> sin θ<sub>2</sub></p><p>1.62 × sin <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>C</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> = 1.52 × sin 90°</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>C</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> = sin<sup>–1</sup> (<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>5</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>6</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math>) = 69.8°</p><p>由於臨界角小於 70°，當光線到達 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>A</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> 點時便會發生全內反射。</p><p>練習 2.2 第 4 題（第 66 頁）</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_3A02_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"7ecff66bdafc3d73283c6bb88cceb3d538a57d1ff02d6cbab6ec10b01f9819b1","segments":[{"page":29,"kind":"question","box":[185.4491,53.49989511718741,562.4491,256.81585693359375],"text":"例 題 10 光纖包覆層的作用\r\n一款簡單的光纖由塑膠內芯製成，且沒有\r\n包覆層。塑膠的折射率是 1.62。如圖所\r\n示，光線從光纖的一端沿法線進入，並到\r\n達 A 點。\r\n(a) 折射率為 1.7 的污垢意外地黏附在光纖外層的 A 點上。解釋光線\r\n到達 A 點時會否發生全內反射。\r\n(b) 如果以折射率為 1.52 的包覆層包裹內心，光線到達 A 點時會否發\r\n生全內反射？\r\n"},{"page":29,"kind":"answer","box":[185.4491,256.81585693359375,562.4491,473.3528951171875],"text":"題 解\r\n(a) 全內反射不會發生。污垢的折射率比塑膠內芯大，因此光會經\r\n折射進入污垢。\r\n(b) 根據斯涅耳定律，\r\nn1 sin θ 1 = n2 sin θ 2\r\n 1.62 × sin C = 1.52 × sin 90°\r\nC = sin–1 (\r\n1.52\r\n1.62)\r\n = 69.8°\r\n由於臨界角小於 70°，光線到達 A 點時會發生全內反射。\r\n單元練習 2.2 Q4 (p.66)\r\n70° A \r\n污垢\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["answer","tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"}}